    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16180" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσθμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>short-drawn breath, panting,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσθμα καὶ ἱδρώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					15.241
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργαλέῳ ἄσθματι</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπ᾽ ἄσθματος κενοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					484
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσθματι στρευγόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Tim.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					93
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ ἄσθματος ἀδυνατεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					568d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				556d
			</span></i>; as symptom of anger, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Ir.</u>
				p.27
			</span></i> W.; <i>death-rattle,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				10.74
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Medic.,
				<i>asthma,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				3.22
			</span></i>(pl.), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>breath, breathing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Mosch.
				3.53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DDeor.</u>
				11.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philum.
				<u>Ven.</u>
				36.3
			</span></i>; <i>blast,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρκτῴοις ἄσθμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.677
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. φλογός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Coluth.
					179
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεραυνοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			. (On the accent v. Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.522
			</span></i>.)</div>
